Assuming that GDSM is gray dragon scale mail (you should specify, it could 
be green).

What weapon are you weilding?

If your weilding Excalibur (Or the Staff of A, or Stormbringer, these are 
less likely however) I would say go with the cloak of displacement. You'll 
have a lower Magic Cancelation, but the leveldrain resistance from 
Excalibur will help that.

If not I would go with the elven cloak for magic cancelation.

Also, you should not have wished for a cloak of magic resistance if you 
already had, and were planing to keep, a suit of gray dragon scale mail. 
The GDSM provides magic resistance, which is the primary purpose of the 
cloak of magic resistance.

Off the top of my head I would consider the following wishes. (Probably in 
this order)
Amulet of Reflection (if you already did Sokoban and didn't find one)
An artifact weapon (if your playing neutral, Lawfuls can dip for Excalibur)
Gauntlets of Power
Boots of Speed
A magic marker (write scrolls of enchant armor or enchant weapon)
Some sort of figurine (I play petless, but some people like them)

